@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Resumefolio | Evidence to feasibility decision
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify capability, option, constraints and dependent gate;
:Define criteria, investigation scope and evidence needs;
:Collect dated sources and authorized check results;
:Assess relevant dimensions and cross-module effects;
if (Enough evidence for the dependent decision?) then (yes)
 if (Evidence supports the option within constraints?) then (yes)
  :Present recommendation, limits and remaining follow-up;
  if (Owner records a proceed decision?) then (yes)
   :Proceed within the evaluated scope and phase gates; <<#173B34>>
  else (not yet)
   :Retain the proposal for review; <<#49351C>>
  endif
 else (conflict)
  :Compare alternatives, costs and consequences; <<#49351C>>
  :Owner records revise / defer / stop for the evaluated option;
  :Reassess changed proposals before dependent acceptance;
 endif
else (not yet)
 :Keep the dependent conclusion unresolved; <<#49351C>>
 :Record owner, next action and review gate;
 :Obtain an actual decision for any proposed deferral;
endif
:Preserve revision, evidence and actual decision;
:Update related records and reassess when conditions change;
stop
legend bottom
Proceed is bounded by the evaluated question and existing phase gates.
Document completion is not technical feasibility, coding permission or release approval.
Stopping an option does not silently remove an agreed capability.
endlegend
@enduml
